pwd : shows current working directory 
ls: list the files and directories
ls -l: this shows the detailed file info
ls -a: this shows the hidden files
ls -la: this shows the detailed file info and hidden files
mkdir: this helps in create a new directory
cd : helps in changing directory
cd . : stay in current directory
cd .. : helps in going back one directory( like clikcing back button) 
touch read.txt : helps in creating a empty file
vi read.txt: helps in writing the content to the file

